{"verdicts":[{"item":"P1-1","status":"resolved","note":"loop.ts now returns mwProcessed.output, so pipeline modifications—including quality hints and fail-closed secret redaction—reach the model."},{"item":"P1-2","status":"resolved","note":"Whitespace-only accumulated text now sets isEmpty, activating fallback/failure handling and recording the learned-routing outcome as unsuccessful."},{"item":"P1-3","status":"resolved","note":"engine.ts tracks the concrete model from routing and model-retry events and uses routedModelId at both recordFailure sites."},{"item":"P2-4","status":"not-resolved","note":"Expired quarantines are swept and recentOutcomes is capped, but quarantinedUntil itself has no cardinality cap and can exceed MAX_TRACKED_MODELS when many IDs are quarantined within one cooldown. The window eviction is also insertion-order FIFO, not LRU."},{"item":"P2-5","status":"not-resolved","note":"JSON.stringify failures are handled, but warningIssued is still set before the returned object is constructed. A throwing object spread/getter can therefore still burn the one-shot; the cyclic-output test covers serialization only."}],"new_P0_P1":[]}
